   "id": "note1",
   "text": "**Quote remix: JSON schema + Jinja**\n\nThe Hub Dataset node names `Abirate/english_quotes` as a bare repo id. `remix` is an LLM Structured column with a JSON schema (enum mood, hashtag array), `share_card` is Jinja with an `if` and a `for` over the JSON, and `byline` is a helper it reads that the dataset drops. Preview, then Rows to Dataset.",
